(This is not owing to lack of the essential human faculties necessary to) Tj T*
(such achievements, nor to any inherent disability of sex, but to the) Tj T*
(present condition of woman, forbidding the development of this degree of) Tj T*
(economic ability. The male human being is thousands of years in advance) Tj T*
(of the female in economic status. Speaking collectively, men produce and) Tj T*
(distribute wealth; and women receive it at their hands. As men hunt,) Tj T*
(fish, keep cattle, or raise corn, so do women eat game, fish, beef, or) Tj T*
(corn. As men go down to the sea in ships, and bring coffee and spices) Tj T*
(and silks and gems from far away, so do women partake of the coffee and) Tj T*
(spices and silks and gems the men bring.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The economic status of the human race in any nation, at any time, is) Tj T*
(governed mainly by the activities of the male: the female obtains her) Tj T*
(share in the racial advance only through him.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Studied individually, the facts are even more plainly visible, more open) Tj T*
(and familiar. From the day laborer to the millionnaire, the wife?s worn) Tj T*
(dress or flashing jewels, her low roof or her lordly one, her weary feet) Tj T*
(or her rich equipage,?these speak of the economic ability of the) Tj T*
(husband. The comfort, the luxury, the necessities of life itself, which) Tj T*
(the woman receives, are obtained by the husband, and given her by him.) Tj T*
