(these new forces, feels them, gives way to them in loyal service, it) Tj T*
(fails to reach the level from which all further progress must proceed,) Tj T*
(and falls back. Again and again society has so risen, so failed to grasp) Tj T*
(new duties, so fallen back.) Tj T*
